                      \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;179m    needs SMITHERY_API_KEY set where the gateway runs\u001b[39m                                  \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252msaidsef-mc\u2026e-analyser  hosted  A Model Context Protocol (MCP) application for aut\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252msmithery-ai-github     hosted  Access the GitHub API, enabling file operations, r\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mdata-githu\u2026announceme  hosted  GitHub platform changelog feed. $0.01/query. Regis\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mdata-trend\u2026po-discove  hosted  Trending GitHub repos: new & rising daily. $0.01/q\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mgithub-dev\u2026r-sourcing  hosted  Hiring developers? Find and source software engine\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mgithub-org\u2026al-scanner  npm     Resolve a company domain to its GitHub organizatio\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mgithub                 pypi    Manage repositories, users, releases, and automate\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mgithub                 hosted  GitHub repo analytics: stars, trending, code searc\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mgithub-repos           hosted  Scrape GitHub repository metadata, stars, forks, t\u2026\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245m\u2502\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252mb